WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:09.259
[electricity hums]

00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:26.776
[metallic clink]

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.863
Either someone left a statue
of a Speaker down here, or...

00:00:29.904 --> 00:00:32.741
[heavy footfalls]

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:45.712
Cyclops!

00:00:52.927 --> 00:00:54.888
Stone-eye cyclops.

00:00:54.929 --> 00:00:57.140
Right out of the family bestiary.

00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:59.392
God shits in my dinner once again.

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:08.568
Oopf!

00:01:09.986 --> 00:01:10.987
[screams]

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.656
[grunting]

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:28.505
Come on. Come on!

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:30.173
You're dead!

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:32.133
Stop and notice you're dead.

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:35.303
[grunts]

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.347
Ugh! Bastard.

00:01:46.856 --> 00:01:48.066
[grunts]

